pted ledger runs money, contracts and apps. The network mines itself (Σ-blocks, CPU-only). Apps live on-chain (TELA) and wallets approve every interaction (XSWD). EPOCH turns app usage into funding. Everything private — nothing to take down." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;gradientColor=#F7FAFF;gradientDirection=south;strokeColor=#;strokeWidth=1.5;shadow=1;fontSize=14;fontColor=#1C2A3A;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1508" width="2480" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
